<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Amcor edges up despite profit drop.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Amcor edges up despite profit drop.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in paper and packaging group Amcor Ltd edged higher on Monday despite reporting a six percent slump in year net profit, and brokers predicted the worst was almost over for the battered blue-chip.</p>
</text>
